Continental’s digital capabilities are growing every day. Our Data & Customer Solutions IT team creates a wide range of technology solutions for Continental’s Global Sales and Marketing teams – and we want you to join us!
 Our team continuously works on the digitalization of our business-to-business processes and end consumer communication, using leading web technologies and a strong focus on data science and artificial intelligence. We run Continental’s global customer relationship management platform, which supports our Sales colleagues in their daily interaction with customers.
 If you’d love to join a global team that works on the latest technologies and creates value-added solutions for customers, Continental is the perfect match for you.
 The Salesforce DevOps Engineer / Developer is responsible for designing, building, deploying, and supporting scalable Salesforce solutions while ensuring reliable CI/CD, release governance, and deployment automation. The role combines hands-on Salesforce development expertise with strong DevOps and release management capabilities to deliver changes safely, consistently, and with full traceability across environments.
 Key tasks : 
